<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 28.7.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 28.7.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 150,000 shares in Budimex SA at 28.7 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Budimex was trading at 26.9 zlotys in 260,245 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
